":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-11T15:11:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T16:25:14Z","closed_at":"2026-03-11T15:39:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117326","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117326.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117326.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds a \"Reveal in Tree\" action (default shortcut: `F`) to the Scene Tree and FileSystem docks. When a filter/search is active, it clears the filter, expands parent nodes, and scrolls to the selected item — revealing its position in the full hierarchy.\r\n\r\nThe shortcut only fires when the filter is active. Otherwise `F` passes through to the Tree's built-in incremental search. Typing `F` in the filter text field still types the letter normally. No conflicts with viewport shortcuts.\r\n\r\nA context menu entry is also added, visible only when the filter is active.\r\n\r\n### Demo\r\n\r\n**FileSystem** — new \"Reveal in Tree (F)\" option:\r\n<img width=\"508\" height=\"396\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/690d55ae-9f30-49d3-9b9c-60e626055abd\" />\r\n\r\n**Scene Tree** — new \"Reveal in Tree (F)\" option:\r\n<img width=\"527\" height=\"569\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c85ecce0-91fd-42a5-a64c-d8d16b77118c\" />\r\n\r\n**Video of the feature**:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/afc9ba38-1e2d-4e51-adfe-6252e64559b5\r\n\r\n### AI Disclosure\r\n\r\nCode was written by an LLM (Claude) based on my directions, then reviewed, tested, and iterated on by me.","closed_by":{"login":"MRxRadex","id":5471816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NzE4MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5471816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex","html_url":"https://github.com/MRxRadex","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MRxRadex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117326/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}